# Pond Prophet: "When this creature enters, draw a card." Hybrid {G/U}{G/U} is paid by one green and one blue mana (CR 107.4e),
# so each half is payable by either color. Bot1's Prophet draws Bot1 one card on entering; the Ornithopter that enters
# afterwards draws nothing (it is the Prophet's own ability, CR 603.2), and Bot2 entering a Prophet of its own draws Bot2 a card
# and leaves Bot1's hand alone.

